<section class="inner-sec" style="padding-top: 10px;">
  <div class="sec-eyebrow">How we build</div>
  <h2>Fast, simple, and yours</h2>
  <p class="lede">No page builder, no plugin updates, no monthly "premium theme" fees. Every 406 site is a hand-built static site on modern hosting — which is why they load fast, stay secure, and don't break in the night.</p>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc"><strong>Built for the phone in their hand</strong>Most local visitors are on a phone looking for your number, your hours, or a way to book. Those are one tap from the top of every page.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Loads in a blink</strong>Static pages on a global CDN — no database, no bloated theme. Speed is one of the twelve grades, and it's measured, not assumed.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Found by Google and by AI assistants</strong>Titles, descriptions, structured data, sitemap, Google Business Profile link-up — the on-page basics search engines reward, done on day one. Because the pages are real HTML rather than assembled in the browser, ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google's AI answers can read your services and hours too. Builder sites often can't be read at all.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Your domain, your site</strong>It goes live on your own domain. If you already have one, we migrate it. Nothing is locked into us.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Works with your front desk</strong>Website chat, missed-call text-back, and booking can plug straight in — so a visitor who lands at 9 PM gets an answer, not a contact form.</div>
    <div class="svc"><strong>Honest grades, both ends</strong>You see the scorecard on your old site and the same scorecard on the new one. If a column isn't A− or better, we keep working.</div>
  </div>
</section>

